# ============================================================================
#  KORE FORMAT â€” Official Killer Language Showcase
#  Killer Optimized Record Exchange (.kore)
#
#  Demonstrates why KORE beats Parquet+Snappy, Arrow, and CSV:
#    âœ… PAX columnar layout   â€” zero tuple reconstruction overhead
#    âœ… Auto compression      â€” DictRLE / Delta / LZ77 per column
#    âœ… Bloom filters         â€” O(1) existence check, skip entire chunks
#    âœ… Column pruning        â€” read ONE column without touching others
#    âœ… Per-column encryption â€” salary encrypted, names stay plain
#    âœ… Global dictionary     â€” strings stored once, indexed everywhere
#    âœ… Pure Killer stdlib    â€” zero external dependencies
#
#  Run: killer-native kore_showcase.killer
# ============================================================================

